<div class="yi-terminal__body">
<div data-prompt="#" class="yi-terminal__command">
<span class="yi-terminal__input">systemctl restart caddy</span>
</div>
<div class="yi-terminal__output yi-terminal__output--danger">Job for caddy.service failed because the control process exited with error code.
</div>
<div data-prompt="#" class="yi-terminal__command">
<span class="yi-terminal__input">caddy validate --config /etc/caddy/Caddyfile</span>
</div>
<div class="yi-terminal__output yi-terminal__output--warn">warning: Caddyfile input is not formatted
</div>
